  "body": "Put this card into play in your play area and search the chaos bag for a \"0\" or \"+1\" chaos token and seal it on this card. This action does not provoke attacks of opportunity.\n⭕ When you or another investigator at your location would reveal a chaos token during a skill test: Resolve the token sealed here as if it were just revealed from the chaos bag, instead. Then, discard Proof of Concept.\n【Forced】 - At the end of the round, if Proof of Concept is in your play area: Discard it.",
